Hello everyone,

After a few weeks of work, we have finally reached a new phase of our game, the update v0.2! In this update we made several changes to the game's hud, added three new companies, skip tutorial option and the first step to scenario customization, opening doors for more ideas and features.
Implementations:
- It is now possible to customize the agency's wallpapers;
- New HUD visual identity;
- Added function "Skip Tutorial";
- Addition of 3 new companies: Barbershop, Garage and Restaurant;
- Removed means of communication: Internet;
- Fixed bug that prevented player progress in the German language.

Subsequently, we intend to increase the possibilities of scenario customization and make new changes to the HUD in order to improve the player's experience with the game.

If you find bugs or have any ideas on how to improve the game's interface, please contact us in the Steam community.


~Sakakibara
